msgid "选项"
msgstr "Options"

msgid "自动"
msgstr "Auto"

msgid "默认启用 Direct3D 11 加速 visual_quality 的 luma、GMSD 与 MS-SSIM 指标；codec 编码/解码仍使用 native CPU 库，失败或小图会自动回退 CPU。"
msgstr "Direct3D 11 acceleration is on by default for the visual_quality luma, GMSD and MS-SSIM metrics; codec encode/decode still uses the native CPU libraries, and small images or failures fall back to CPU automatically."

msgid "系统默认字体"
msgstr "System default font"

msgid "就绪"
msgstr "Ready"

msgid "释放以加入图片队列"
msgstr "Drop to add images to the queue"

msgid "当前不能接收外部文件"
msgstr "External files cannot be accepted right now"

msgid "主导航"
msgstr "Main navigation"

msgid "编码队列"
msgstr "Encode queue"

msgid "参数设置"
msgstr "Parameters"

msgid "菜单参数"
msgstr "Menu parameters"

msgid "设置"
msgstr "Settings"

msgid "常用参数"
msgstr "Common parameters"

msgid "格式"
msgstr "Format"

msgid "输出格式"
msgstr "Output format"

msgid "首选 AVIF"
msgstr "Choose AVIF"

msgid "极高压缩率 · 支持 HDR · 最高 12-bit"
msgstr "top compression · HDR · up to 12-bit"

msgid "AWJ 针对 AVIF 做了大量实测与调参，代价是编码较慢；若某台设备打不开，优先更新查看端，而不是降级格式。WebP 编码快、兼容最好，适合作为第二格式，但只有 8-bit。JXL 更现代，能无损转封装 JPEG 并支持 HDR，压缩率略逊 AVIF。JPGLI 是新的 JPEG 编码器，在保持 JPEG 兼容的前提下明显提升压缩率。PNG 为无损输出，也可在参数设置中独立编辑。"
msgstr "AWJ has put a lot of real-world testing and tuning into AVIF; the price is slower encoding. If some device cannot open the file, update the viewer rather than downgrading the format. WebP encodes fast and has the best compatibility, which makes it a good second format, but it is 8-bit only. JXL is more modern, can losslessly transcode JPEG and supports HDR, though it compresses slightly worse than AVIF. JPGLI is a new JPEG encoder that clearly improves compression while staying JPEG-compatible. PNG is lossless output and can also be edited independently in Parameters."

msgid "编码器"
msgstr "Encoder"

msgid "AVIF 编码器"
msgstr "AVIF encoder"

msgid "保持“自动”就是最优解"
msgstr "Leave this on Auto"

msgid "优先 aom，超限自动切 zenrav1e"
msgstr "aom first, auto-switch to zenrav1e past the limit"

msgid "aom 支持高位深与 420/422/444，是默认主力。svt-av1-hdr 各项指标均不及 libaom，仅作备选。zenrav1e 能吃下超大图，但不适合当常规默认。"
msgstr "aom supports high bit depth and 420/422/444, and is the default workhorse. svt-av1-hdr trails libaom on every metric, so it is only a fallback. zenrav1e can swallow very large images, but it is a poor everyday default."

msgid "质量"
msgstr "Quality"

msgid "由视觉质量自动控制"
msgstr "Driven by visual quality"

msgid "1-100，越大越好；填 100 及以上为无损"
msgstr "1-100, higher is better; 100 or above is lossless"

msgid "AWJ 会把该刻度映射到有损编码器的 crf / quality；默认值取开发者判定的视觉无损点：AVIF 70、WebP 95、JXL 85、JPGLI 90。PNG 固定为无损，质量值为 100。JPEG 转 JXL 默认走无损转封装。"
msgstr "AWJ maps this scale to the lossy encoders' crf / quality. The defaults sit where the developer judged the result visually lossless: AVIF 70, WebP 95, JXL 85, JPGLI 90. PNG is always lossless with quality fixed at 100. JPEG to JXL defaults to lossless transcoding."

msgid "视觉质量"
msgstr "Visual quality"

msgid "空由质量决定，1-100"
msgstr "Empty follows quality, 1-100"

msgid "推荐值为50"
msgstr "Recommended value: 50"

msgid "填写后会对同一张图反复编码，用 GMSD / MS-SSIM 搜索目标画质，效果类似质量驱动的 VBR，但耗时会翻数倍。"
msgstr "Once set, the same image is encoded over and over, searching for the target quality with GMSD / MS-SSIM. It behaves like quality-driven VBR, but takes several times as long."

msgid "速度"
msgstr "Speed"

msgid "默认/可选0-10"
msgstr "Default/optional 0-10"

msgid "0-10，越大越快"
msgstr "0-10, higher is faster"

msgid "默认值是速度与画质的平衡点，自动映射到各编码器的 preset / effort / cpu-used。同一质量下数值越小压缩效率越高。不支持调速的格式会自动隐藏这一行。"
msgstr "The default sits at the balance point between speed and picture quality, and maps automatically to each encoder's preset / effort / cpu-used. At the same quality, lower values compress more efficiently. Formats with no speed control hide this row automatically."

msgid "资源限制"
msgstr "Resource limits"

msgid "线程"
msgstr "Threads"

msgid "自动/线程数"
msgstr "Auto/thread count"

msgid "留空 = 自动"
msgstr "Empty = automatic"

msgid "核心多时预留 4 个"
msgstr "reserves 4 on many-core CPUs"

msgid "填数字即为总线程上限。自动策略给桌面和 UI 留余量：逻辑核心 ≥12 预留 4 个，5-11 预留 2 个，2-4 预留 1 个，单核仍用 1 个。"
msgstr "A number sets the total thread budget. The automatic policy leaves headroom for the desktop and the UI: 4 threads held back at ≥12 logical cores, 2 at 5-11, 1 at 2-4, and a single core still uses 1."

msgid "内存"
msgstr "Memory"

msgid "内存限制"
msgstr "Memory limit"

msgid "例如 4（单位 GiB）"
msgstr "e.g. 4 (in GiB)"

msgid "min(总内存 80%, 可用 50%)"
msgstr "min(80% of total, 50% of free)"

msgid "填数字即为内存占用上限，单位 GiB。设置页可以解除内存限制，解除后覆盖这一项。"
msgstr "A number sets the memory ceiling, in GiB. The settings page can lift the memory limit, which then overrides this value."

msgid "尺寸限制"
msgstr "Size limit"

msgid "图片尺寸限制"
msgstr "Image size limit"

msgid "无限制"
msgstr "Unlimited"

msgid "手动"
msgstr "Manual"

msgid "自动 = 保证还能正确解码"
msgstr "Auto keeps the image decodable"

msgid "按格式与解码能力限制边长，也可以切换成无限制。手动时取宽、高、长边、短边里最严格的一项。"
msgstr "Edge length is capped by format and decoder capability; you can also switch to unlimited. Manual takes the strictest of width, height, long edge and short edge."

msgid "手动尺寸"
msgstr "Manual size"

msgid "最大宽度"
msgstr "Max width"

msgid "最大宽"
msgstr "Max width"

msgid "最大高度"
msgstr "Max height"

msgid "最大高"
msgstr "Max height"

msgid "最大长边"
msgstr "Max long edge"

msgid "最大短边"
msgstr "Max short edge"

msgid "格式高级选项"
msgstr "Advanced format options"

msgid "位深"
msgstr "Bit depth"

msgid "保持原片"
msgstr "Keep source"

msgid "自动至少 10-bit"
msgstr "Auto uses 10-bit or better"

msgid "源 ≤10-bit 提升到 10-bit，源 ≥12-bit 收到 12-bit；显式填写则以填写值为准。AVIF 支持 8 / 10 / 12-bit。"
msgstr "Sources at ≤10-bit are lifted to 10-bit, sources at ≥12-bit are capped at 12-bit; an explicit value always wins. AVIF supports 8 / 10 / 12-bit."

msgid "色度采样"
msgstr "Chroma subsampling"

msgid "自动 = 跟随源"
msgstr "Auto follows the source"

msgid "JPGLI 支持 444 / 422 / 420，自动时用 Jpegli 默认采样。"
msgstr "JPGLI supports 444 / 422 / 420; auto uses the Jpegli default subsampling."

msgid "一律以 YUV 编码：源是 420 / 422 / 444 就原样保留，RGB 与 RGBA 视作 444，灰度按 420 处理。"
msgstr "Everything is encoded as YUV: sources already at 420 / 422 / 444 are kept as they are, RGB and RGBA are treated as 444, and grayscale is handled as 420."

msgid "渐进"
msgstr "Progressive"

msgid "JPGLI 渐进级别"
msgstr "JPGLI progressive level"

msgid "关闭"
msgstr "Off"

msgid "普通"
msgstr "Normal"

msgid "更细"
msgstr "Finer"

msgid "哈夫曼"
msgstr "Huffman"

msgid "优化哈夫曼表"
msgstr "Optimize Huffman tables"

msgid "启用 XYB"
msgstr "Enable XYB"

msgid "透明通道"
msgstr "Alpha channel"

msgid "强制开启"
msgstr "Force on"

msgid "自动 = 源真的用到才保留"
msgstr "Auto keeps alpha only when it's used"

msgid "源没有 alpha，或者 alpha 全不透明，都会去掉这一层。保留时 alpha 与颜色用同一个质量值压缩；编码器不支持有损 alpha 时，只有 alpha 退回无损，颜色仍按质量压缩。"
msgstr "If the source has no alpha, or its alpha is fully opaque, the channel is dropped. When alpha is kept, it is compressed at the same quality value as the color; if the encoder cannot do lossy alpha, only the alpha falls back to lossless while the color still follows the quality setting."

