msgid "此格式只决定正在编辑哪组右键参数；右键子菜单决定最终输出格式。这里的参数只用于右键菜单，不影响左侧的普通参数设置。"
msgstr "This only picks which set of context-menu parameters you are editing; the context submenu decides the final output format. These parameters apply to the context menu only and do not affect the normal parameters on the left."

