msgid "开启后，若内置的专业级 Native 解码器（如 libavif, libwebp）加载图片失败，系统将自动尝试使用 Windows WIC（Windows Imaging Component）作为兜底解码路径。"
msgstr "When enabled, if the built-in professional native decoders (such as libavif or libwebp) fail to load an image, Windows WIC (Windows Imaging Component) is tried automatically as a fallback decode path."

msgid "GPU 加速视觉质量"
msgstr "GPU-accelerated visual quality"

msgid "视觉质量未达标时兜底输出"
msgstr "Output a fallback when visual quality is not met"

msgid "填写视觉质量后生效；未填写视觉质量时此选项保持可选，但不会参与本次编码。启用后，visual_quality 搜索没有候选达到目标时仍输出最接近目标的候选；关闭时未达标会失败。"
msgstr "Takes effect once visual quality is set; while visual quality is empty this option stays selectable but plays no part in the encode. When enabled, if no candidate in the visual_quality search reaches the target, the closest candidate is still written; when disabled, missing the target fails the task."

msgid "解除 20 GiB 输入/运行时上限"
msgstr "Lift the 20 GiB input/runtime cap"

msgid "仅当前会话生效，不会写入 AWJ.jsonc。"
msgstr "Applies to this session only; never written to AWJ.jsonc."

msgid "警告：图片或工作集过大时可能导致内存耗尽、进程被系统杀死或整机卡死。仅在明确需要处理超大文件时临时开启。"
msgstr "Warning: an oversized image or working set can exhaust memory, get the process killed by the system, or freeze the whole machine. Turn this on temporarily only when you genuinely need to handle very large files."

msgid "启用实验性编码器（zenrav1e）"
msgstr "Enable experimental encoders (zenrav1e)"

msgid "启用后，构建支持时可在自动大图链路中使用 zenrav1e；普通队列自动不会选择实验编码器。不可用时相关路径会跳过或置灰。"
msgstr "When enabled and the build supports it, zenrav1e can be used in the automatic large-image path; the normal queue never picks an experimental encoder on its own. Where it is unavailable, the related paths are skipped or greyed out."

msgid "关于后端"
msgstr "About the backend"

msgid "Studio 输出支持 libavif / AOM、svt-av1-hdr、实验 zenrav1e、WebP、JXL、JPGLI 与无损 PNG。"
msgstr "Studio output supports libavif / AOM, svt-av1-hdr, experimental zenrav1e, WebP, JXL, JPGLI, and lossless PNG."

